  _phoneDialogue:
    _sentences:
    - Hey honey, how are the pictures turning out?
    - Great job pal! Well, I know I said I'd grab you tonight, but we've almost cleared
      everything important from the house anyway...
    - Why don't you just stay there again tonight? You can have your own little sleepover!
    - Go on downstairs and watch a bit of TV before before bed. It'll help you relax,
      pal. Promise.
  _phoneDialogueMorning:
    _sentences:
    - Well, look who finally got out of bed...
    - I swear, one of these days you're gonna sleep so late, it'll be dark when you
      get up!
    - I swung by this morning to grab some more stuff, but there's still so much
      junk there...
    - 'Why dont you go ahead and take some more pictures for me, pal? '
    - If you can keep yourself busy for a few hours, I'll swing by tonight and grab
      you!
    - 'Get to work, buddy. '
